  <div class="final-check">
    <h3>Launch only when these statements are true</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>The chosen direction answers the business brief and passes the documented scorecard.</li>
      <li>The wordmark has been properly typeset or drawn, and the symbol has clean vector geometry.</li>
      <li>Required small, monochrome, mobile, social, document, signage, and production tests have passed.</li>
      <li>Approved color combinations have been tested for their actual text, interface, and graphic uses.</li>
      <li>Fonts, icons, templates, stock elements, and reference materials have a recorded source and license.</li>
      <li>Trademark and copyright questions have been assessed at a level appropriate to the business risk.</li>
      <li>The production package, usage sheet, approval record, and responsible owner are in place.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <p class="restrained-cta">Need a second set of eyes before launch? Markethink can review the brief, shortlist, identity system, and real-use tests with you. <a href="/schedule-a-walkthrough/">Book a focused walkthrough.</a></p>
